OL,3,ATrump questions midterm election
OL,4,Aintegrity after previously accepting
OL,5,Aresults
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump questioned the
OL,8,Flegitimacy of the US midterm election
OL,9,Fresults following sweeping losses for
OL,10,FRepublicans, just days after telling
OL,11,Fthe press he would accept the outcome.
OL,13,FOn election night, Trump told the New
OL,14,FYork Times he was "absolutely willing"
OL,15,Fto accept the results, in which
OL,16,FDemocrats retook both chambers of
OL,17,FCongress.
OL,19,FHe appeared to reverse course on Truth
OL,20,FSocial on Monday, asking: "Does anybody
OL,21,Freally believe that this 'Election' was
OL,22,Fhonest".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
