OL,3,ATrump questions midterm election
OL,4,Aintegrity after previously accepting
OL,5,Aresults
OL,6,
OL,7,FState and local officials across the US
OL,8,Freported mostly smooth elections this
OL,9,Fyear. Some key races, including US
OL,10,FSenate contests in Alaska and
OL,11,FMississippi, have yet to be called.
